    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "3.12 Lifespan",
      "source_hash": 5728024396423484334,
      "context_hash": 6169955612361586945,
      "translation": "3.12의 수명",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:11:57.663630Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "3.12 received bugfix updates approximately every 2 months for approximately 18 months.",
      "source_hash": 8434521172962807336,
      "context_hash": 1844805112080522829,
      "translation": "3.12는 약 18개월 동안 약 2개월마다 버그 수정 업데이트를 받았습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:11:57.663631Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Some time after the release of 3.13.0 final, the tenth and final 3.12 bugfix update was released.",
      "source_hash": 3657955061279549849,
      "context_hash": 6545741551054739575,
      "translation": "3.13.0 정식 버전이 출시된 후 얼마 지나지 않아 3.12의 열 번째이자 마지막 버그 수정 업데이트가 출시되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:11:57.663631Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "After that, it is expected that security updates (source only) will be released until 5 years after the release of 3.12.0 final, so until approximately October 2028.",
      "source_hash": 10903305005774373794,
      "context_hash": 13362018001546477546,
      "translation": "그 후에는 3.12.0 정식 버전 출시 후 5년이 될 때까지, 즉 2028년 10월경까지 보안 업데이트(소스 전용)가 출시될 것으로 예상됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:11:57.663632Z",
      "issues": []
